{
  "id": "acfPublisher0001",
  "name": "PUB · Publisher",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c07bd67c-d4e1-5f9e-b3d3-3f79bdbd4f06",
      "name": "Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -420,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## PUB · Publisher\n**Purpose**: publish due posts exactly once (PB-3…PB-6): an attempt row with an idempotency key is written before the call; ok -> published + notices; failed -> retries with backoff for 30 min, then failed + buttons; no answer -> unknown, the editor decides. The stop switch is checked in the same query (PB-9). Adapters: Telegram channel (photo + caption or text), blog and preview (local).\n**Trigger**: every 30 s + fast path (publish now).\n**Invariant 9**: guests, eval and preview platforms resolve to the preview adapter in SQL.",
        "height": 160,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "caa8d264-e305-5903-9165-8fc46225fad3",
      "name": "Every 30 s",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
